{# A product card's primary action: add the product's first plan to the cart
   and start buying it. The plan can be changed at checkout.

   A prescription goes on with the assessment intent, which is what the product
   page's "Start Assessment" does, so the buyer lands on the questionnaire.
   Anything else has no questionnaire, so it goes straight to checkout.
   "Learn More", beside it, is the way to the product page.

   `icon_class` sizes the arrow to the card it sits in. #}
<form method="post" action="{{ url('/cart/add') }}" class="contents">
  <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{ csrf_token }}" />
  <input type="hidden" name="slug" value="{{ product.slug }}" />
  <input type="hidden" name="variant_id" value="{{ product.variants is defined and product.variants is not empty ? product.variants[0].id : '' }}" />
  <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="{{ current_path }}" />
  <button type="submit" name="intent" value="{{ product.kind == 'rx' ? 'assessment' : 'checkout' }}" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-primary h-[41px] px-5 text-base font-medium sm:h-auto sm:py-3 text-primary-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-primary-hover focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-hover">
    Get Started
    <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="{{ icon_class|default('size-[17px]') }}"></i>
  </button>
</form>
